    cpu: rv64: enable f16 dst for jit_rvv_1x1 convolution

    Relax the dst_dt==f32 gate to allow f16 dst when Zvfh is available, and
    narrow the f32 accumulators to f16 (vfncvt.f.f.w) on store. Resolves the
    ref:any fallback for 1x1 f16:f16:f16 convolution (resnet_50 res2a_branch2a).

